<title>UK: Ghana 1996/97 cocoa purchases cumulative 299,166 t.</title>
<headline>Ghana 1996/97 cocoa purchases cumulative 299,166 t.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana's cocoa board said on Monday its purchases of the 1996/97 crop for the 25th week ending April 3 was 45 tonnes, or a cumulative 299,166 tonnes.</p>
</text>
